    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20040" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλᾱκ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lazy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				9.1
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλακῶδες βαίνειν καὶ
				θρύπτεσθαι</span> walk <i>mincingly</i>, of a coxcomb,
				<i><span class="en">
